          "content": {
            "markdown": "C数组a[3]包含3个同类型元素，合法下标为0、1、2。后续代码场景给出求和实现，练习场景提供题目；本讲解只说明长度和下标。"
          }
        },
        "content_digest": "3485a8c28be48b2370e7fe2ad45a95aea033bcd3e2cb2265cb24e65ccac62abb",
        "dependency_digest": "587a01ce1d0dd8dac1310bfb3ce63e9413cf0cb8fef90f75e52c504488df85a5",
        "upstream": []
      },
      {
        "resource_id": "a91a7d3c-7447-586a-88f0-fe64ecdf4e88",
        "role": "code",
        "envelope": {
          "resource_type": "code",
          "prompt_version": "learning-resources-v1",
          "content": {
            "language": "C",
            "source": "int sum_sample(void) {\n    int a[3] = {4, 6, 9};\n    int s = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 3; ++i) s += a[i];\n    return s;\n}",
            "expected_output": "函数返回19，没有标准输出。",
            "key_steps": [
              "初始s=0；i=0轮后s=4，i=1轮后s=10，i=2轮后s=19；随后i=3，3<3为假，退出，不访问a[3]，返回19，无打印。"
            ],
            "display_only": true
          }
        },
        "content_digest": "3dc160a6f4c2288872ca672661dfad8f8da3f93f429f70090b4bdfebe4bf542e",
